  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\00\00\00\00$How many drops are left in the pool.\00\00\00\04pool\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00JThe wallet authorises its own claim; the contract pays out of its balance.\00\00\00\00\00\05claim\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04user\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0bFaucetError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\15One drop, in stroops.\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07DataKey\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05Token\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06Amount\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04Last\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00/Unix time at which this wallet may claim again.\00\00\00\00\0anext_claim\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04user\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00Gtoken: the PLUNCH Stellar Asset Contract; amount: one drop, in stroops.\00\00\00\00\0d__constructor\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05token\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bFaucetError\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\004The wallet already claimed within the last 24 hours.\00\00\00\08Cooldown\00\00\00\01\00\00\00.The faucet's PLUNCH balance is below one drop.\00\00\00\00\00\05Empty\00\00\00\00\00\00\02")
